{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15539","headline":"禁中春松 · 陆贽","name":"禁中春松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴阴清禁里，苍翠满春松。\n雨露恩偏近，阳和色更浓。\n高枝分晓日，虚吹杂宵钟。\n香助鑪烟远，形疑盖影重。\n愿符千载寿，不羡五株封。\n傥得回天眷，全胜老碧峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆贽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}